  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "hot-mess-data",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for The Hot Mess of AI: How Does Misalignment Scale With Model Intelligence and Task Complexity?\n\t\n\n\n\nThis dataset contains the raw output of the experiments of our paper The Hot Mess of AI: How Does Misalignment Scale With Model Intelligence and Task Complexity?.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tStructure\n\t\n\n\n\n\nmcq/: Raw JSONL files of all runs with the LM Eval Harness Fork here.\nmwe/: Model-Written Eval Suite, both multiple choice mcq and open-ended formats, obtained with the codebase of the\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hot-mess/hot-mess-data.",
